&amp;\ddots&amp;\ddots&amp;\ddots&amp;O\\
&amp;&amp;O&amp;C_{L}&amp;I\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x_{\pi(1)}\\[3.99994pt]
\vdots\\[3.99994pt]
x_{\pi(L)}\end{bmatrix}=\begin{bmatrix}u_{\pi(1)}\\[3.99994pt]
