<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present Myosotis, an SSM and attention-like layer based on an efficient recurrent inversion of the quad-tree-structured matrix. The benchmarks suggest that when the data align with the quad-tree structure, Myosotis is a superior choice, otherwise performing on par with SSM. We believe that this opens up new possibilities on a structured layer design.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="bib" class="ltx_bibliography">
