<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Python style pseudo-code</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here, "b" is a batch dimension, "h" is a head dimension, "p", "c" is a dimension corresponding to the nodes over the layer, and the last two dimensions are either block dimensions for coefficients or block dimension and number of right parts for right part input.
<span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:341.6pt;">
<span id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting ltx_align_center">
<span id="LST1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
                    
                    
                    
                  
</span>
